From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:30:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! script: Delay the load event while web fonts are
 loading

css/css-text-decor/parsing/text-decoration-inset-computed.html defines
its subtests once `document.fonts.load("20px Ahem")` resolves. On plain
upstream that happens after the load event, when the harness has
finished, so only the first subtest is recorded. With this patch the
load event waits for the font, so all 16 subtests run. They fail
because Servo doesn't support `text-decoration-inset`.

Validation: `./mach test-wpt --processes 8 --timeout-multiplier 2 /css/css-text-decor/parsing/text-decoration-inset-computed.html` with release builds: one subtest with the stack up to the previous patch, 16 failing subtests from this one on, with SpiderMonkey and QuickJS. With these expectations, the ohos-main tip has no unexpected result for it.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; bisected and written by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .../text-decoration-inset-computed.html.ini   | 45 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 45 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-text-decor/parsing/text-decoration-inset-computed.html.ini b/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-text-decor/parsing/text-decoration-inset-computed.html.ini
index 0cf9038ab32..324e796fe2f 100644
--- a/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-text-decor/parsing/text-decoration-inset-computed.html.ini
+++ b/tests/wpt/meta/css/css-text-decor/parsing/text-decoration-inset-computed.html.ini
@@ -1,3 +1,48 @@
 [text-decoration-inset-computed.html]
   [Property text-decoration-inset value '0px']
     expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '0']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '0px 0px']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '0.5em']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '-1em']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '-1ch -1ch']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '1px 2px']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '1ch -1ch']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value 'calc(1em / 4) calc(-1ch)']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value 'auto']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '10%']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '0 20%']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '10% 20%']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value '10px -20%']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value 'calc(10% - 1em) 0']
+    expected: FAIL
+
+  [Property text-decoration-inset value 'calc(10% + 1ch) calc(-20%)']
+    expected: FAIL
